 rt\nFull Stage Makeup Instruction Sheet:\n•  Apply foundation and p
 owder matching skintone\n•  Light skin tone eye shadow over entire 
 eye\n•  Dark brown eye shadow over crease\n•  Medium brown eye
  shadow blended over brown\n•  Black fake eyelashes (note: apply ma
 scara to own lashes before application of fake lashes)\n•  Apply ey
